    "text": "Order under Section 11 BY VIRTUE of the powers vested in me by Section 11 of the National Thoroughfares Act, No. 40 of 2008, I, Kabir Hashim, Minister of Highways & Road Development and Petroleum Resources Development, do by this Order designate the National Highway which was designated as an \"Expressway\" by Order published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2148/ 41 of 08.11.2019 and speci\ufb01 ed in the Schedule to this Order to be an \"User Fee National Highway\".",
